                    <xsd:documentation>
                        <eds:Definition>items list: list of the single product units</eds:Definition>
                        <eds:AggregationNote>it may be used to identify the pieces/chains that the Subcontractor must use for the commissioned work with multiple serial Ids for each one</eds:AggregationNote>
